@startuml uc_monitoring_lingkungan
left to right direction
title SIGAP — Use Case: Monitoring Lingkungan

actor "Warga Desa" as Warga
actor "BMKG / USGS / OpenWeatherMap" as ExtData
actor "AI API" as ExtAI

rectangle "Sistem SIGAP" {
  usecase "Lihat Dashboard Lingkungan" as UC1
  usecase "Lihat Ringkasan AI" as UC2
  usecase "Tarik Data Eksternal" as UC10
  usecase "Minta Ringkasan ke AI API" as UC10b
}

Warga --> UC1
Warga --> UC2

UC1 .> UC10 : <<include>>
UC2 .> UC10b : <<include>>

UC10 --> ExtData
UC10b --> ExtAI

note right of UC10b
  Jika AI API gagal/kuota habis,
  sistem menampilkan data mentah
  dengan indikator "ringkasan
  otomatis tidak tersedia"
  (lihat PRD 5, Fallback AI - Draft).
end note

@enduml